    "intro_html":  "Shoko is Ghanaian home cooking in one pot: beef braised in a fried tomato and pepper base, thickened with ground peanuts, and turned deep green with spinach at the end. It is rich without being heavy, and it reheats better on day three than it does on day one. Each bowl carries \u003cstrong\u003e{{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e and {{cal}} calories for about \u003cstrong\u003e${{cost_ps}}\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost).",
